# Rocketship Component Placement

- **Rocketship (packages/base) or the app**
  - A new component belongs in Rocketship (`packages/base`) only when **all** of these hold:
    - It is reusable across apps.
    - It has no app-specific business logic.
    - It can expose a stable public API.
  - Otherwise it belongs in the consuming app.

- **State the decision**
  - Every OpenHands task that adds a component must state the placement decision (Rocketship vs app) and why.

- **Review**
  - The founder reviews and merges all Rocketship PRs.
